<description>&lt;p&gt;The Myanmar military has intensified cross-border airstrikes, bombing a health centre near the Thai border, striking Thai homes in Tak province, and hitting Karen positions in Mae Hong Son, while also targeting an IDP camp after an ASEAN envoy visit. Thai authorities reported damage to about 17 buildings from strikes on October 31 and additional damage from stray bomb shrapnel, prompting a seven-day suspension of unofficial border trade. Refugee flows continue as Myanmar refugees fill labor gaps in Thailand and migrant workers face attacks outside the UN office. 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPT0hFWHdXT3NFQzVVVTVhNzl5dkUtVnVjZUlGd202TG1ERkluOW1MWk12TU8wUU40MW1kV0FYc2NqQVBJM0lvWk05Y1FFQUM0YWMzN0tTbkRvMlBwbXBpeTA3dVhvWEl3X1B6QVRjSXlCcjRGYmpZMnhpa0ZzOW1SQ0tSRXRKUTJZZWM2alBrbmpnWDdETzd0ZHBER3poSUdCcmVhY3lTWWZickVjVEtRd0ZIRFFBRDh4Wnhr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNd25lb1d3STE5REUxUURpLVpxcnM0UUswYVhZT3MwbENIb1l1WUtRMmt0ZHRmaVg1LXpmbVE1RExQMUNmbUtvanZqNEpTczNTWDFIYUk0bW56bkJzNlFBVkNjYTBUNmVUV1kzczJVTk5kVWY4MVF2aFliZFlxeldWYXNVb1VBMnNJbE5Z?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE5mNWFpY1NWZ3ltOFI5WGY3Yk5GUlJKbnFJNTd1UGNua3J1SDVYcmRNUk1HMG5JMlZtVENsenVOSHlxeEpndUZ0TGQyQ3Q4NFBiSGpsUlFaWHpjVklmRGFHNkFn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaosod English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTFBGOW4zeVpndVFNSFVKWmdsZWx6Z0Y4Y09KajFwdU1WRW9SaFRBREZoRDZ5MzZVcGFHbnNRQmZxVVhmRjhCTzVDU0pZTXNGeDNGeFBPaWVFNkd6RUp2ei05WTFuODczVmR5a1BhbGk2WQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Narinjara News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;ht